<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第五幕 · 怎么判断</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>第一句：harness 才是真正的变量</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 384, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 32px", background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>三句</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", marginTop: 10}}>变量 · 边界 · 值不值得换</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 744, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 18}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", padding: 22, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56"}}>第一句 · harness 才是真正的变量</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", marginTop: 10}}>模型大家都在用同一个，差距在底下那圈。</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", padding: 22, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 28, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>第二句 · 先看清你手上那圈东西的边界</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)", marginTop: 8}}>→ P40</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", padding: 22, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 28, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>第三句 · 值不值得换</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)", marginTop: 8}}>→ P41</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>39 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
